('Anything worth having is worth fitting inside of a box.\n\nExcept people, of course! Can\'t put $p in a box, right?\n\n<Hobart gets lost in thought for a moment.>\n\nAnyway, I\'m just making a few adjustments here. I\'ll get this suit back up and running in no time... with a few explosive improvements!', 'When will we next hunt, $p?\n\nIn all my years on Azeroth, there has never been a shortage of monsters to dispose of.', 161969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
