('We\'ve managed to seize another one of the Horde\'s siege weapons. Time to turn the tables on them!', '', 157867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 112142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('No! No! Impossible. Da boss ain\'t gonna like dis. Ol\' Bwonsamdi not been losin\' a spirit in... oh, dis be bad.', '', 157866, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 113241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
