('Wanna be meetin\' Bwonsamdi?', '', 155750, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 108502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Livin\' on de land must be a sad little life for ya.', '', 155749, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 108501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
