('Can you taste de salt in de air? Now you are home.', '', 155739, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 108494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Taz\'okun! Welcome, traveler!', '', 155738, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 108493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('The job is done... but you could have left a less anemic blood trail in your wake. Try to do better next time.', '', 155737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 109149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Ay! It\'s you!', '', 155736, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 108492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
