('The fleet is not lost. It is being held prisoner in an unnatural storm.', 'The fleet is not lost. It is being held prisoner in an unnatural storm.', 154727, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 111838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
