('More food for the rot!', '', 154667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 106617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('G\'huun will rise!', '', 154666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 106612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Your world will end!', '', 154665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 106611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Your decay is inevitable.', '', 154664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 106381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('The tickle in your throat. The itch in your mind. I have always been with you.', '', 154663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 106380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('All life withers. Accept this and be transformed.', '', 154662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 106379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
