('Finally, when the planet ruptures like a giant boil, my rot will spread across the cosmos.', '', 154655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 106378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('You will carry my pestilence, and a vast, bubbling, putrid cyst will cover the world.', '', 154654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 106377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Such eager hosts. You will be the first to receive my gift.', '', 154653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 106376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
