('', 'Dat was for bringing destruction to Dazar\'alor, you vile creature!', 154651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 106872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'De rest is up to us. We will put an end to G\'huun\'s disease.', 154650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 106875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Warning, significant threat of contamination beyond this point. Quarantine protocols prevent me from proceeding.', 154649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Perfection, $p! We have more than enough mines to strike against the Venture Company.', '', 154648, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 110791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'It does not matter how he returned. My knife will send him back to de abyss.', 154647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 106874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('I see many mines to choose from.', '', 154646, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 110790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Analysis indicates high levels of corruption. Hypothesis: G\'huun reanimated this specimen and enhanced it. Further testing required.', 154645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Zul?! How is he alive? I saw him die by my father\'s hand!', 154644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 106873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('These mines weren\'t built to detect turtles! We can gather them safely.', '', 154643, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 110876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'You seem to have missed one.', 154642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 106865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Tests focused on the ability of G\'huun\'s corruption to reanimate expired tissue. Results were inconclusive and specimens were destroyed.', 154641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Observation accurate. This facility has run numerous experiments on loa to research solutions for Old God corruption.', 154640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
