('', 'Activating all consoles will grant access to G\'huun\'s vault, where the specimen may be purged by activating the reorigination drive.', 154608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'In order to destroy the specimen, you must reactivate the vault consoles located throughout this wing.', 154607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
