('Drain Life consumes your target\'s life force, healing you as it damages your foe.', '', 153801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Use Shadow Bolt on the target dummy.', 153798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Use Shadow Bolt on the target dummy.', '', 153797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
