('', 'Use Wildfire Bomb to burn down all of the enemies.', 153782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Use Wildfire Bomb to burn down all of the enemies.', '', 153781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'They\'re even more effective against packs of enemies, as the wildfire coats all foes in a cone behind your target.', 153780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
