('Winds be kind!', 'Winds be kind!', 153769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104837, 104838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Steer clear of sirens!', 'Steer clear of sirens!', 153768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104835, 104836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('My loa cries out! Zul\'s heresy knows no limits!', '', 153767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 109709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Stay warm!', 'Stay warm!', 153766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104833, 104834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Reclaim my ship, $n. Den we will deal with de usurpers who tried to claim my throne.', '', 153765, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 109707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
