('', 'Oh, Alexander... I wish you were here now...', 149850, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 103806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Thank you, friend.', '', 149849, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 102844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
