('I did not force anyone to follow me, Vorrik... Our people are conquerors...', '', 149846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 107669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('You will regret... seeing this...', 'You will regret... what you saw...', 149845, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 104302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Lady Waycrest is a powerful enemy...', 'Lady Waycrest is a powerful enemy...', 149844, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 104301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
