('Friends, family, and honored guests. We gather on this fine autumn day to celebrate the joining of Lucille and Alexander.', '', 149832, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 103416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Very well.', '', 149831, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 103415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'By all means. Please proceed, father.', 149830, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 103804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Shall we?', '', 149829, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 103414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('She will be down shortly. She asked that I begin in her stead.', '', 149828, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 103413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'It\'s fine, father. Where is mother?', 149827, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 103803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Please forgive my tardiness.', '', 149826, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 103412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('But where is Lady Waycrest?', '', 149825, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 109177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Here he comes!', 149824, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 109176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Oh, and do convey my apologies for the delay.', '', 149823, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 103411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Please inform the happy couple I will be down shortly.', '', 149822, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 103410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Oh, you\'ve found it! Thank the tides!', '', 149821, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 103409, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Are you trying to waste our time?', 149820, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 105949, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'We are looking for a book. Don\'t you think we would have already checked the bookcase?', 149819, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 105948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Why would my husband put his notebook in Lucille\'s pack? Are you daft?', 149818, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 105947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('I don\'t believe I left them with Lucy\'s letters, but I suppose it\'s prudent to be sure.', '', 149817, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 103408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('While I am thankful for your help, I must ask that you not rummage through my daughter\'s undergarments...', '', 149816, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 103407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Her heart isn\'t doing our house any favors...', 149815, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 105946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Lucy is merely following her heart, Meredith. Just as I did when I wed you.', '', 149814, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 103406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'I\'m telling you, Arthur, you should not allow this. Our daughter, marrying a common merchant?!', 149813, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 105945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Thank you so much for coming. We are honored to have you.', 149812, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 103802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Why have you come here?', '', 149811, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 102842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Lucy? You\'ve come... wait, you\'re not Lucy.', '', 149810, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 102841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Nor you. Your father is displeased dat you have brought dese creatures here. He has ordered me to collect you.', '', 149809, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 109613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Ensured my victory no matter what happens here. General Jakra\'zet already has my key, and by now... I suppose he has yours, as well.', '', 149807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 107667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('What have you done, Korthek?', '', 149806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 107537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
