('Ah, our escort arrives. Just as I said, Princess.', '', 148872, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 106157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Come, $n. Dis way.', '', 148871, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 105584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
