('As the sands continued to spread, Korthek grew hungry for war. He plotted to unearth the C\'Thrax and use him as a weapon to conquer the continent.', '', 148379, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 107546, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Although immensely powerful, Sulthis could not create the barrier alone. Korthek and I lent him our aid, and together, we sealed Mythrax within the great pyramid.', '', 148378, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 107545, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('After witnessing his destruction firsthand, we knew that something must be done to prevent anyone from raising Mythrax again.', '', 148377, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 107544, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Our loa sacrificed herself to save us from that monstrosity. She struck the C\'Thrax down, but not before it was able to destroy the disc at the heart of Atul\'Aman.', '', 148376, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 107543, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Long ago, Mythrax the Unraveler descended upon our lands. He slaughtered all in his path, troll and sethrak alike.', '', 148375, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 107542, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
