('Sadly, da name \'Pinkspear tribe\' already be taken.', '', 144636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 105566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('I\'ve lost me head! It be about, ahh, yea big. If ya find it, it let me know.', '', 144635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 105565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Come back if ya need me help.', '', 144634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 105561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Don\'t be gettin\' mixed up in da voodoo.', '', 144633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 105560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
