('For da Darkspear!', '', 144630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 105563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('I be listenin\'.', '', 144629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 105562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Very well... you asked for it. Commencing re-origination of entire universe.', '', 144628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Continued poking will not make systems run faster.', '', 144627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Potential new target for containment.', '', 144626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Error. Please do not try again.', '', 144625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Interaction complete.', '', 144624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
