('Unit Hezrel online. Goal: corruption containment.', '', 144618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Your behavior is getting old... even older than me!', 144617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 98562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Ever hear the tale of the tortollan who lost her mind and attacked the pest who bothered her?', 144616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 98561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'You\'re making me feel fighty.', 144614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 98560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'All done here?', 144613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 98559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Pester someone else next time.', 144612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 98558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Took you long enough.', 144611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 98557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Ugh. What is it?', 144610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 98556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Do you really need to talk to me?', 144609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 98555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'What do you want now?', 144608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 98554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
