('I die well...', 'I die well...', 143913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104272, 104273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Our thorns... will cover the land...', 'Our thorns... will cover the land...', 143912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104270, 104271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('The Briarback... will still grow strong...', 'The Briarback... will still grow strong...', 143911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104268, 104269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('My walk... ends.', 'My walk... ends.', 143910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 104266, 104267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
