('We embrace power. We do not fear it.', '', 143683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('The shadows serve us.', '', 143682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Bal\'a dash, malanore.', '', 143681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Greetings, traveler.', '', 143680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('My eye patch has never switched sides! I mean... who would mix up something like that?', '', 143679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Working for Sylvanas has its... challenges. Being dead has made her even bossier. But, uh... do not tell her I said that.', '', 143678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Queen\'s champion or no, I can out-shoot Nathanos any day of the week.', '', 143677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Hair like this does not just happen on its own. It requires constant attention.', '', 143676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Never again shall a king reign in Silvermoon.', '', 143675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
