('The Light of the Sunwell be with you.', '', 143670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Silvermoon will know prosperity again.', '', 143669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
