('We have made many sacrifices.', '', 143665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('I proudly serve as regent lord.', '', 143664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
