('I don\'t know how ta fix this. Not sure anyone does. But we\'ve gotta keep tryin\'.', '', 143001, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 94517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Since returnin\' from Argus, the cries o\' Azeroth have been... overwhelmin\'. Such pain...', '', 143000, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 94516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Champion... \'tis good ta see a familiar face in these dark times.', '', 142999, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 94515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
