('Take no truth for granted.', '', 142864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('The universe is full of mystery.', '', 142863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('New opportunities lay before us.', '', 142862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('The past is written. The future is not.', '', 142861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Shorel\'aran.', '', 142860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('Our people do not fear the shadows.', '', 142859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 94473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
