('Welcome, Akunda de Nimble.', '', 137455, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 105852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('I slayed Deathwing. Surely you\'ve heard of me?', 'I slayed Deathwing. Surely you\'ve heard of me?', 137454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
