('', 'Now then, I believe we have some witches to kill.', 137412, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 97591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Thus is reborn the Order of Embers.', 137411, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 97590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'The knowledge within will grant you, as well as our forces, the edge needed to destroy the foul coven that plagues our land.', 137410, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 97589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'If you are prepared to follow the path of the Order, take up the book.', 137409, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 97588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Here it is... the last resting place of the Order of Embers. Are you ready to revive ancient history?', 137408, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 97587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
('', 'Come along, the book should be in here!', 137407, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 97586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 28153),
